    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Purchased new 2018, No. 95 Ashfield Avenue is an exceptional three-bedroom semi-detached home with converted attic that now extends to approximately 144 sq. m. Ideally located within the Ashfield Development, this property is not overlooked to the front. The accommodation comprises entrance hall with walk in understairs storage, guest toilet, living room and open plan kitchen/dining/family room with utility room off. Upstairs there are three double bedrooms, main bedroom with en suite and a family bathroom. An impressive large attic conversion with en-suite completes the accommodation. On inspection you will be impressed by the feature high ceilings and high-quality finishes throughout. This award-winning development built by MKN Property Group is convenient to Dublin Airport, M1 & M50 motorways and is within walking distance to all amenities, bus routes, schools, shops, medical centre, crèche, playgrounds, GAA and soccer pitches. Viewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\n* ‘A’ rated home purchased new in 2018 - Quality construction with high levels of insulation\r\n* Large attic room with en suite and quattro Velux windows \r\n* Not overlooked to the front\r\n* Cobble lock driveway with parking for two cars - Home wall mounted EV charger\r\n* Ideally located within Ashfield, close to the Ridgewood Playing Pitches\r\n* Bright and spacious c. 144 sq. m. including spacious attic room with en-suite\r\n* Three double bedrooms each with built in wardrobes\r\n* Stylish hi-gloss kitchen by Nolan Kitchens with soft close doors & drawers, island unit with breakfast counter and storage\r\n* Integrated kitchen appliances:\r\nElectric hob, double oven, microwave\r\n* Spacious utility room with shelving\r\n* Downstairs guest toilet and separate understairs walk in storage\r\n* Main bedroom with en-suite\r\n* Rear garden upgraded with porcelain tiles, artificial grass, flower beds and timber shed\r\n* Burglar alarm\r\n* Highest levels of insulation in walls, roof, and floors - Very efficient and costs less to heat than older secondhand homes\r\n* A-class Dimplex Air Source Heat Pump\r\n* Large capacity hot water storage\r\n* Covered by a 10-year HomeBond guarantee\r\n* Mains powered smoke detectors\r\n* Elegant brick and render exterior elevation\r\n* High-performance double-glazed Grady joinery windows throughout\r\n* No management fees\r\n* Walking distance to Primary & Secondary schools, bus routes including Swords Express, shops, crèche & medical centre\r\n* Easy access to Dublin Airport, M1 & M50 motorways"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hall   -   Laminate flooring. Stairs to first floor. Guest toilet and separate walk in understairs storage.                            \r\n\r\nGuest toilet   -   1.4m x 1.5m\r\nTiled floor. Toilet and sink. \t\r\n\r\nStorage   -   Walk in understairs storage/cloakroom.\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\nLiving room   -   5.1m x 3.4m\r\nLaminate flooring. Dimplex optiflame electric fire.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining/ Family room   -   4.8m x 5.5m\r\nImpressive open plan kitchen/dining/family room. Part tiled floor and part laminate flooring. Hi-gloss quality built in kitchen with integrated appliances.\r\nFeature island unit with breakfast bar and storage. Utility room off.  \r\n\r\nUtility room   -   1.4m x 1.9m\r\nTiled floor. Worktop. Additional fitted shelving. \r\n\t\r\nFIRST FLOOR:\r\n\r\nLanding \t-\tCarpet fitted. Stairs to attic room.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1   -   4.2m x 3.4m\r\nSpacious master bedroom with built-in wardrobes and en-suite off. Carpet fitted. \r\n\r\nEn-suite   -   1.4m x 2.3m\r\nTiled floor, part tiled walls. Toilet, sink and shower. Heated towel rail.  \r\n\r\nBedroom 2   -   4.5m x 2.7m \r\nLarge double room with built-in wardrobes. Carpet fitted.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3   -   3.3m x 2.7m \r\nDouble room with built-in wardrobes. Carpet fitted.\r\n\r\nBathroom   -   2.6m x 2.0m\r\nTiled floor, part tiled walls. Bath with shower, toilet and sink. Heated towel rail.\r\n\r\nAttic room   -   5.0m x 4.3m\r\nCarpet fitted. Quattro Velux windows with blackout blinds. Access to storage space at eaves. En suite off.\r\n \r\nEn-suite   -   2.7m x 1.2m\r\nFully tiled with shower, toilet and wash hand basin with storage. Wall mounted mirror. Heated towel rail. Velux window."
      },
